---
description: Never add AI co-author trailers to git commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# No AI co-authors in commits

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Claude`, or any AI/agent co-author trailer to commit messages.
- Never add Asssisted-by / Generated-by / Signed-off-by trailers that attribute work to an AI.
- Commit author/committer must remain the user's git identity only.
- If a tool or environment tries to inject such a trailer, strip it before committing.
